{"id":"656321","name":"扇贝肉拌贡菜金针菇","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/656321/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"扇贝","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"贡菜","amount":"10根"},{"name":"金针菇","amount":"100g"},{"name":"花生米","amount":"1把"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"两斤扇贝煮熟取肉。","img":"images/656321/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"过水再烫熟。","img":"images/656321/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"贡菜泡水。","img":"images/656321/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡好以后切段，开水烫一下，20秒，捞出过凉水。","img":"images/656321/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"金针菇洗干净。","img":"images/656321/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"开水烫熟。","img":"images/656321/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蒜切末，杭椒切段，干辣椒花椒麻椒准备好。","img":"images/656321/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热油浇在辣椒上面。","img":"images/656321/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加酱油醋盐糖各一勺，麻油一勺。","img":"images/656321/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"贡菜倒入。","img":"images/656321/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"食材都放一起。","img":"images/656321/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"花生米是灵魂。","img":"images/656321/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"拌一拌。","img":"images/656321/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}